@startuml
title UML sequence behaviour — Migrate existing data
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}
actor "Deployment operator" as actor
box "Backend — FaithTech.Community.Cli" #D1FADF
  participant "CliApp" as cli
end box
box "Backend — FaithTech.Community.Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
  participant "OrganisationsAndCapabilities migration" as mig
  participant "FaithTechSeed" as seed
  database "Community database" as db
end box
actor -> cli : faithtech-community migrate
cli -> mig : Database.Migrate() applies pending migrations in one transaction
mig -> db : Create Organisations, RoleDefinitions, RoleCapabilities, RoleGrantRules, Chapters, PartnerStages, EventTypes, ResourceTypes, OrganisationAdminRosters
mig -> seed : Fixed ids and keys
mig -> db : Insert FaithTech organisation, definitions, grant rules, stages, event types, resource types
mig -> db : Add OrganisationId to every scoped table; backfill FaithTech id; set NOT NULL (L2-151 AC4)
mig -> db : Recreate unique indexes with OrganisationId first (L2-130 AC4)
mig -> db : ProfileRoles: add RoleDefinitionId, ChapterId; map Role value to definition of the same name; drop Role (L2-151 AC4)
mig -> db : ResourceShareRoles, NoteShareRoles, announcement audiences: map Role value to definition id
mig -> db : Partners.Stage, Events.Type, Resources.Type: map enumeration value to entry of the same name; drop column (L2-151 AC4)
mig -> db : Distinct trimmed, case-folded HomeCity and Events.City values
db --> mig : Values
mig -> db : Insert one Chapter per value; set Profiles.ChapterId and Events.ChapterId on exact match (L2-141 AC6)
mig -> mig : Unmatched values set to none and written to the migration log
mig -> db : Drop HomeCity and City; IX_Profiles_HomeCity becomes IX_Profiles_ChapterId
mig -> db : Move SystemAdminRosters singleton to OrganisationAdminRosters(FaithTech); drop SystemAdminRosters
mig -> db : Leave OpenIddict tables untouched; web client keeps https://app.faithtech.community (L2-151 AC4)
db --> mig : Commit
mig --> cli : Applied
cli --> actor : Exit 0; migration log lists unmatched cities
== Next request to the API ==
actor -> db : CurrentRolesMiddleware computes a City Lead's capabilities from the city-lead definition (L2-151 AC5)
@enduml
